---

<BaseLayout {meta}>
  <Header />
  <HeroLocalServer meta={meta} />

  <article class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl">

    <header class="mb-8">
      <p>General-purpose software categorized by function, with many offering both desktop (portable) and self-hosted server options: from personal dashboards to custom web apps. 
      Includes self-hosted alternatives to SaaS platforms, often built with Docker, PHP, Node.js, or Python, and managed via tools like Dockge or Umbrel.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-8 p-4 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg scroll-mt-6" id="communication-private">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
      <IconLocal name="fluent-color--chat-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Communication
      </h2>
      
      <p>Private, decentralized alternatives to mainstream messaging, email, and video conferencing. Tools like Matrix/Element, Mailcow, and Jitsi enable end-to-end encrypted chat, secure email, and ad-free meetings without relying on Big Tech infrastructure.</p>
        
      <h5 class="text-xl text-center font-semibold my-8">Private & Secure Messenger Apps Alternatives</h5>

      <CardSmall items={messaging} />

      <h5 class="text-center text-xl font-semibold my-8">Private Business & Team Communication Tools</h5>

      <CardSmall items={team} />

    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="creative">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
      <IconLocal name="fluent-color--design-ideas-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Creative Software</h2>

        <p>Self-hosted tools for design, audio, video, and publishing. Includes photo editors, digital audio workstations, vector graphics, 
        and collaborative whiteboards, often containerized for offline or LAN-based creative workflows. 
        </p>

        <h5 class="text-center text-xl font-semibold my-8">Photo Editors and Management</h5>

        <CardSmall items={photo} />

        <h5 class="text-center text-xl font-semibold my-8">Design and Illustration</h5>

        <CardSmall items={design} />

        <h5 class="text-center text-xl font-semibold my-8">Audio Editors and Management</h5>

        <CardSmall items={audio} />

        <h5 class="text-center text-xl font-semibold my-8">Video Editors and Hosting</h5>
      
        <CardSmall items={video} />
        
        <h5 class="text-xl font-semibold my-4">Publishing and Content</h5>

        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li><strong><a href="https://nextcloud.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-lime-600">Nextcloud (Self-hosted)</a></strong><br />
          A full-featured suite for file hosting, collaboration, and document management.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-lime-600">Paperless-ngx (Self-hosted)</a></strong><br />
          A community-supported open-source document management system.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://www.seafile.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-lime-600">
          Seafile</a></strong><br />
          Known for high performance and reliability, especially with large files and extensive syncs, focusing on efficient file management and sharing.
          </li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://calibre-ebook.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-lime-600">Calibre / Calibre-Web (Portable/Self-hosted)</a></strong><br />
          A powerful e-book management tool, with a web-based version for browsing and downloading library content.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="https://www.bookstackapp.com/" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-lime-600">BookStack (Self-hosted)</a></strong><br />
          A simple, self-hosted platform for organizing documentation and knowledge.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>


    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="finance">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
      <IconLocal name="fluent-color--coin-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Finance & Capital</h2>

        <p>Personal and small-business financial management with full data ownership, free from cloud fees, ads, or data harvesting.</p>
        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Firefly III, budgeting</li>
          <li>Umbrel, Ronin, cryptocurrency nodes</li>
          <li>Portfolio trackers</li>
          <li>Accounting tools</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="knowledge">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4"><IconLocal name="fluent-color--chat-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Knowledge Database</h2>
        <p>Systems to capture, organize, and retrieve information over time, personal knowledge bases, designed for long-term access without vendor lock-in.</p>
        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Standard Notes, Joplin, note-taking</li>
          <li>Wiki.js, BookStack, wikis</li>
          <li>LinkAce, bookmark managers</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="local-ai-llm">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4"><IconLocal name="fluent-color--chat-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Local AI & LLMs</h2>
        <p>Run open-source large language models (Llama 3, Mistral, Phi) directly on your hardware. 
        Enables private chat, coding assistance, document analysis, and automation, no API keys or data leaks.</p>
        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Ollama</li>
          <li>LM Studio</li>
          <li>vLLM</li>
          <li>llama.cpp</li>
          <li>llamafile</li>
          <li>Jan</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="network">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4"><IconLocal name="fluent-color--chat-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Network & Hosting</h2>
        <p>Foundational tools to deploy, connect, and expose services securely, the backbone of any homelab.</p>
        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Docker</li>
          <li>Dockge</li>
          <li>Dockge: Visual Docker Compose manager for custom apps.</li>
          <li>Portainer</li>
          <li>Caddy, Nginx Proxy Manager, reverse proxies</li>
          <li>Tailscale Funnel, Cloudflare Tunnel, for secure tunneling</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 p-6 bg-linear-to-br from-zinc-100 to-white dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-indigo-950/20 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg" id="productivity">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4"><IconLocal name="fluent-color--document-folder-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Productivity & Office</h2>
        <p>Self-hosted replacements for cloud office suites, all under your control, with no subscription required.</p>
        <ul class="list-image-arrow list-outside pl-2 ml-4 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Nextcloud, Seafile, file sync</li>
          <li>CryptPad, OnlyOffice, collaborative editing</li>
          <li>Planka, WeKan, task management</li>
          <li>CalDAV/CardDAV, calendar and contact sync</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="h-[3px] border-none bg-radial-[at_50%_50%] from-zinc-200 to-zinc-50 dark:from-zinc-700 dark:to-zinc-950 to-100% my-16" />

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4"><IconLocal name="fluent-color--link-multiple-24" class="w-6 h-6 inline-block" /> Trusted Resources</h2>
      <p class="text-sm italic bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-indigo-900/20 border border-inrdigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900 rounded-md p-4 mb-4">The external sites are not affiliated with us. 
         We include them because they provide reliable, transparent, 
         and community-driven information that aligns with our commitment 
         to honest, open-source tooling.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(16rem,1fr))] gap-4 mb-8">
    {refurl.map((item) => (
      <CardLink 
        title={item.title}
        description={item.description}
        href={item.href}
        buttonText={item.buttonText}
      />
    ))}
    </div>

  </article>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>